  "result": "Excellent! All 62 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**`src/numbering.js`** \u2014 `nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`:\n- Extracts the year from the issue date\n- Filters existing numbers to only those from the same year\n- Finds the maximum counter value\n- Returns the next number in format `INV-<year>-<counter>` with counter zero-padded to 4 digits\n- Starts at `INV-<year>-0001` if no numbers exist for that year\n\n**`issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)` in src/invoices.js**:\n- Assigns the next invoice number using `nextInvoiceNumber`\n- Changes status from `'draft'` to `'issued'`\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` or `NOT_DRAFT` if the invoice isn't a draft\n- Never mutates the input invoice\n\n**9 new tests in `test/numbering.test.js`** covering:\n- Starting numbers, incrementing, year transitions\n- Handling unordered input and malformed numbers\n- Zero-padding to 4 digits\n\n**5 new tests in `test/invoices.test.js`** for `issueInvoice`:\n- Number assignment and status change\n- Property preservation and immutability\n- Rejection of non-draft invoices",
